{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"type":"conformsTo","title":"Conforms To"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Bullet list is a UI element that helps to view in related individual text items grouped together; items usually starting with a number or a bullet."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Bullet list is also known as "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Unordered list","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" or "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ordered list"}]},{"type":"text","text":" and is not an interactive element by default."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misobulletlist"]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"15.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"macOS","introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"tvOS","introducedAt":"16.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"name":"visionOS","introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"11.0"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Structure","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOBulletList"}],"symbolKind":"struct","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOBulletList"}],"modules":[{"name":"Components"}],"title":"MISOBulletList","externalID":"s:14MISOComponents14MISOBulletListV"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/Item"],"anchor":"Structures","generated":true,"title":"Structures"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/init(type:textStyle:isBold:items:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true,"title":"Initializers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true,"title":"Instance Properties"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/TextStyle","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/Type","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/UnorderedAsset"],"anchor":"Enumerations","generated":true,"title":"Enumerations"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true,"title":"Default Implementations"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOBulletList","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/ContentDisplay"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Types","anchor":"Types"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Three types are proposed:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Unordered (by default)","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Collects related items that don’t need to be in a specific order or sequence."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ordered"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Collects related items with numeric order or sequence."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Bare","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": An unordered list without any bullets or alphanumeric sequence.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Types can be mixed in list, but must be identical for the same "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MISOBulletList.NestedLevel"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Levels","anchor":"Levels"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Lists can include nested items to indicate hierarchy or subcategories, with indentation distinguishing each level."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Arrange ordered list items logically, such as ranking by importance, highest to lowest values, or in alphabetical \/ numeric order."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Three levels are maximum."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Text Style","anchor":"Text-Style"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"List can be used with different font sizes:","type":"text"}]},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body Large"}]},{"type":"text","text":": If the text accompanying the list component is the Body Large text. This variant is designed for more visual, engaging experiences."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Body Medium"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": If the text accompanying the list component is the Body Medium text. This variant is best suited for functional, task-oriented experiences."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Cases forbidden by design","level":2,"anchor":"Cases-forbidden-by-design"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"it is not allowed to have a depth of items greater than 3","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Internationalisation considerations","level":2,"anchor":"Internationalisation-considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For latin-based speaking countries, like France, Spain, United Kingdom or Belgium, the european “arabic” numbers are used for the first level of depth"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the ordered bullet list. For the second and third levels, the european alphabets are used with upper and lower case values."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"However for countries speaking arabic, these rules can’t be applied. Indeed, there is no notion of upper and lower case characters in arabic alphabet.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"In addition, the numbers in use (i.e. the european “arabic” numbers like “1, 2, 3”) are accepted in arabic countries, even if the “true arabic” numbers (like “ ٢ ٣ ١”) are used","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in middle-east arabic countries and for official documents.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Thus the MISO ordered bullet list will use “european” numbers for first level, and arabic alphabets for second and third levels.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Code samples","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["       \/\/ 1. Unordered list with bullets","       MISOBulletList {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 1.1. Item of Unordered list with bullet as tick, a text style","       \/\/ body medium and text bold","       MISOBulletList(type: .unordered(asset: .tick),","                      textStyle: .bodyMedium,","                      isBold: true)  {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 2. Bare list with 3 items","       MISOBulletList(type: .bare) {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 3. Ordered list with 3 items","       MISOBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ 3.1. Ordered list with 3 items in first level,","       \/\/ and one item as sub item (second level),","       \/\/ and 2 items as sub item in (third level)","       MISOBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\") {","               MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1\") {","                   MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.1\")","                   MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.2\")","               }","           }","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }","","       \/\/ Same Bullet list but items in third level with free icon as bullet","       let icon = Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\")","       MISOBulletList(type: .ordered) {","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1\") {","               MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1\", subListType: .unordered(asset: .icon(icon))) {","                   MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.1\")","                   MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 1.1.2\")","               }","           }","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 2\")","           MISOBulletList.Item(\"Label 3\")","       }"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Rich text recommendations","level":2,"anchor":"Rich-text-recommendations"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Rich text can be applied for bullet list whatever the "},{"code":"isBold","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" flag is."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Strong text can be used sparingly within alert messages to highlight key information.","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined text must not be used for emphasis, as it is commonly associated with links."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Underlined links must be bold."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If a hyperlink is needed within the content, the underlined style should be used."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Italic should be used with care, some brands do not allow it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"No other text styles should be used."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","text":"Accessibility considerations","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Always check the results of rich text mode with high contrast, light and dark modes, and Voice Over vocalization.","type":"text"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"1.1.0 (Figma component design version)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Version","style":"note"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 1.2.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside","name":"Since","style":"note"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOBulletList/View-Implementations":{"role":"collectionGroup","title":"View Implementations","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misobulletlist\/view-implementations","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/View-Implementations","kind":"article","type":"topic"},"doc://MISOComponents/7SwiftUI4ViewP":{"type":"unresolvable","title":"SwiftUICore.View","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"},"doc://MISOComponents/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/ContentDisplay":{"role":"article","title":"Content Display","abstract":[{"text":"Some components can be used for ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"content display","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/contentdisplay","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/ContentDisplay","kind":"article","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"},{"type":"card","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOBulletList/body":{"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misobulletlist\/body","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/body","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"body"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","text":"View"}],"title":"body","abstract":[],"type":"topic"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOBulletList/TextStyle":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"TextStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misobulletlist\/textstyle","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The typography style for the list item","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TextStyle","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MISOBulletList.TextStyle","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOBulletList\/TextStyle"},"doc://MISOComponents/documentation/MISOComponents/MISOBulletList/UnorderedAsset":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOCompone